@startuml
hide empty state

AccountCreationState -- CreateAccountEvent:1 >> LoginState
LoginState -- LoginEvent:2 >> ApplicationState
ApplicationState -- ApplyForVisaEvent:3 >> PaymentState
PaymentState -- PaymentMadeEvent:4 >> ApplicationSubmittedState
ApplicationSubmittedState -- ApplicationStatusViewEvent:5 |or| CancelApplicationEvent:6 >> StatusCheckState
StatusCheckState -- ApprovalRejectionEvent:7 >> ApprovalRejectionState
ApprovalRejectionState -- Exit behavior of ApprovalRejectionState:8 >> LoginState
LoginState -- ViewDetailsEvent:9 >> ModificationState
LoginState -- GiveFeedbackEvent:10 >> ModificationState
LoginState -- StatusUpdateEvent:11 >> ModificationState
ModificationState -- LogoutEvent:12 >> AccountCreationState
ModificationState -- ViewDetailsEvent:9 >> ViewDetailsState
ModificationState -- GiveFeedbackEvent:10 >> FeedbackState
StatusCheckState -- StatusCheckEvent:13 >> StatusViewState
StatusViewState -- CheckStatusEvent:14 |or| LogoutEvent:12 >> LoginState

@enduml
